  "prefLabel": "Plc 208.04 Burden of Persuasion for Rulemaking Petitions",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Plc 208.04 Burden of Persuasion for Rulemaking Petitions. The petitioner shall have the burden of persuasion relative to demonstrating that the criteria for denying the petition specified in Plc 208.05(e) are not met.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note #1 at chapter heading for Plc 200) #13427, eff 8-4-22; ss by #13837, eff 12-28-23 (see Revision Note #2 at chapter heading for Plc 200)",
